      "value": "@{61454a10ed97741328f56794|full_name} may not develop mobile but I do know myway around android. It cuts out because of something called audio focus loss. in music players it can happen but the permission gets reinstated. for vrchat mobile once the audio focus loss happens since vrchat mobiles primary way for your voice and audio to go through is using the audio permission on android. So in this case its comeplete audio permission focus loss and the permission basically is disabled untill app restart.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
