  "details": "All audio dies, voice chat, background and music players. This problem started in the first week I got the game, about 2 weeks ago. At first it was simple to fix, I would only need to expand the settings menu to somehow refresh it (not sure why it worked but it did). After the new beta update  it's gotten worse, it could be getting worse regardless but around then it got worse. At that point turning my headset on and off fixed it. It starts cutting out and I can't hear anything then it comes back and fully stops after a few times even with the headset trick. Now currently all it takes is a few times and I have to full close the program for it work only for the whole thing to start over again anyways.",
